<title>USA: Louisville feeder cattle prices steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>Louisville feeder cattle prices steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>LOUISVILLE 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Feeder steers and heifers were steady, compared to last week's close, USDA said.</p>
<p>Feeder Steers - Medium and Large 1 600-700 lbs 80.00-89.50; 700-800 lbs few 72.00-79.50.</p>
<p>Feeder Heifers - Medium and Large 1 600-700 lbs 71.00-78.00; 700-800 lbs 70.00-71.50. Medium and Large 2 600-700 lbs 62.00-71.50. Cattle and Calves Receipts - 1,491</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
</text>
